OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 4 DEC
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,8,     GThe BBC Scottish Symphony
OL,9,     Gcelebrates its 90th anniversary
OL,10,     Gwith music by Grieg, Tippett and
OL,11,     GAyanna Witter-Johnson, with the
OL,12,     Ghelp of pianist Sir Stephen Hough.
OL,13,G2200FThe Essay: Electronic Women
OL,14,     GHannah Peel delves into the
OL,15,     Gstories and sound worlds of five
OL,16,     Gfemale electronic pioneers.
OL,17,     GTonight, the "diva of the diode"
OL,18,     GSuzanne Ciani.
